# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Proprietary domain knowledge -- kept local + in the deployed Firestore RAG
# index (see fixtures/seed_playbook_index.py), never in version control.
# The RAG pipeline only reads this file at index-build time; every runtime
# query goes through the already-built Firestore vector index, so excluding
# it here does not affect the running app.
GOOGLE_ORDERING_REDIRECT_PLAYBOOK.md

